sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Mobile app
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant A as python_auth
    participant M as Motors
    App->>GW: POST /ai/assess + token
    GW->>O: forward
    O->>A: require_roles(User)
    A-->>O: AuthUser, or 401 / 403
    Note over O: body checked as AssessRequest, else 422
    O->>O: build_motor_inputs()
    Note over O: nothing to analyse: 400
    par asyncio.gather, max 2.5 s each
        O->>M: call_motor("triage")
        O->>M: call_motor("visual")
        O->>M: call_motor("vitals")
    end
    M-->>O: MotorOutput, or None if failed
